%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 4b3f2a8c8f344355b16a4d4296ae3f98, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dolphin
  m_EditorClassIdentifier:
  vesselClass: 2
  entries:
  - Element: 1
    AbilityLabel: Crystal Seeding
    AbilityDescription: PASSIVE - no input. A cooldown runs continuously and each time
      it completes the Dolphin seeds a team crystal at a random point in the cell's
      CYTOPLASM (the shell between nucleus and membrane), then restarts immediately.
      Charge shortens that recharge (authored on
      DeployTeamCrystalActionSO.cooldownMultiplierAtFullCharge, x0.5 at level 10; the
      generic map multiplier stays 1.0 so it does not also move the charge-boost
      peak); at level 5 each cycle seeds TWO crystals instead of one.
    Input: 0
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Twin Seed
    UpgradeDescription: Every seeding plants two team crystals instead of one.
  - Element: 2
    AbilityLabel: Drift Trail
    AbilityDescription: Mass raises the VOLUME of each drift prism (authored as the
      trailVolume ElementalFloat on the vessel's VesselPrismController, 1 -> 2.5 at
      level 10, cube root per axis; the generic map multiplier stays 1.0 to avoid
      double-dipping); at level 5 drift prisms arrive shielded - massUpgradeShieldsTrail
      gated on IsDrifting, the same machinery behind the Squirrel's Heavy Trail.
    Input: 2
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Hard Wake
    UpgradeDescription: Drift prisms arrive shielded (one-hit ablative armour).
  - Element: 3
    AbilityLabel: Echo Obliteration
    AbilityDescription: The crystal-impact cone, plus the ECHO SIGHT that aims it -
      hold the right trigger to drop into a zoomed first-person view in which every
      prism inside the blast's current destruction volume lights up. Space carries
      that cone further down-range (authored on
      VesselExplosionByCrystalEffectSO._heightMultiplierAtFullSpace, x2 at level 10;
      the cone's ANGLE is set by skim energy, not by Space, so the two shape the
      blast independently) - and the sight is how that reach becomes legible, which
      is why the two share this slot. At level 5 the blast stops eating the pilot's
      own domain.
    Input: 1
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Clean Blast
    UpgradeDescription: The cone spares your own domain - no more friendly fire.
  - Element: 4
    AbilityLabel: Charge Fill Rate
    AbilityDescription: Time raises the rate the boost meter charges while drifting
      (authored on ChargeBoostActionSO.chargeRateMultiplierAtFullTime, x1.5 at level
      10; the generic map multiplier stays 1.0 because VesselTransformer consumes it
      for boost SPEED); at level 5 danger prisms pay triple skim energy.
    Input: 2
    MultiplierAtFullLevel: 1
    MinMultiplier: 1
    UnlockLevel: 5
    RelockBelowLevel: 4
    LatchPolicy: 0
    UpgradeLabel: Live Current
    UpgradeDescription: Skimming a danger prism grants 3x energy.
